---
layout: base.njk
title: CV
permalink: /cv/
description: Curriculum vitae of Lynne Kiesling.
---
<h1>Curriculum Vitae</h1>
<p><a class="button" href="{{ site.cv_pdf }}">Download CV (PDF) · {{ site.cv_date }}</a></p>

<h2>Education</h2>
<ul class="plain">
  {% for e in appointments.education %}<li>{{ e.title }} <span class="dates">· {{ e.dates }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>Current appointments</h2>
<ul class="plain">
  {% for a in appointments.current %}
  <li>
    <span class="item-title">{{ a.org }}</span>
    {% for r in a.roles %}<span class="item-desc">{{ r.title }} <span class="dates">· {{ r.dates }}</span></span>{% endfor %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>Selected past appointments</h2>
<ul class="plain">
  {% for a in appointments.past %}<li>{{ a.title }} <span class="dates">· {{ a.dates }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>Selected awards and honors</h2>
<ul class="plain">
  {% for a in appointments.awards %}<li>{{ a.title }} <span class="dates">· {{ a.dates }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
